WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,810
Can it be delivered to your home? One hundred pounds guaranteed to be fresh.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,410
Order now, get it delivered immediately

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:08,250
One hundred and one pounds delivered to your home

4
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:13,640
Okay, I'll leave you a pair

5
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,240
It's the kind of pork you ate yesterday. Do you still want it?

6
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:22,580
Do you still have that one here? Which one?

7
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,980
It was Lao Wang yesterday

8
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:30,590
The one I took from you also had the wine box.

9
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:42,220
But it may not be available in the short term. I want all my friends.
